{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41950","headline":"献中书张舍人 · 李中","name":"献中书张舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙桂从攀後，人间播大名。\n飞腾谐素志，霄汉是前程。\n持宪威声振，司言品秩清。\n帘开春酒醒，月上草麻成。\n丹陛凌晨对，青云逐步生。\n照人裴玉莹，鉴物宪陂明。\n下直无他事，闲游恣逸情。\n林僧开户接，溪叟扫苔迎。\n煮茗山房冷，垂纶野艇轻。\n神清宜放旷，诗苦益纵横。\n余刃时皆仰，嘉谋衆伫行。\n四方观啓沃，毕竟念孤平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}